---
layout: layouts/page.njk
title: Newsletters
heading: Alumni Association Newsletters
eyebrow: Alumni
intro: Click below to read the 395 Squadron Alumni Association newsletters – news, memories and updates from former cadets, staff and officers since 2011.
description: 395 Squadron Alumni Association newsletters from 2011 to today (PDF).
permalink: /newsletters/
---
<div class="split">
  <ul class="doc-list" role="list">
    {%- for n in newsletters %}
    <li><a class="doc-link{% if loop.first %} is-latest{% endif %}" href="{{ n.file }}"><span class="doc-icon">{% icon "file" %}</span><span><span class="doc-name">{{ n.title }}{% if loop.first %}<span class="badge">Latest</span>{% endif %}</span><span class="doc-meta">PDF · {{ n.size }}</span></span>{% icon "download", "icon-dl" %}</a></li>
    {%- endfor %}
  </ul>
  <aside>
    <figure class="figure">
      <img src="/assets/img/alumni/newsletters-over-the-years.jpg" alt="A collage of 395 Squadron newsletters over the years" loading="lazy">
      <figcaption>Newsletters over the years.</figcaption>
    </figure>
    <div class="card card-pad" style="margin-top:1.25rem">
      <h2 class="aside-heading">Get the next issue</h2>
      <p>Alumni Association members receive updates about alumni events and newsletters.</p>
      <a class="btn btn-primary" href="/join-alumni/">Join the Alumni Association</a>
    </div>
  </aside>
</div>
